    "body": "For example, with nvim-cmp I have:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n\topts.sources = cmp.config.sources({\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'nvim_lsp' },\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'crates' },\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'copilot' },\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'luasnip' },\r\n\t\t\t}, {\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'buffer' },\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'path' },\r\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'emoji' },\r\n\t\t\t})\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">For example, with nvim-cmp I have:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"\topts.sources = cmp.config.sources({\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'nvim_lsp' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'crates' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'copilot' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'luasnip' },\n\t\t\t}, {\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'buffer' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'path' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'emoji' },\n\t\t\t})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">sources</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">cmp</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">sources</span>({\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>nvim_lsp<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>crates<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>copilot<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>luasnip<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t}, {\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>buffer<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>path<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">name</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>emoji<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n\t\t\t})</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "For example, with nvim-cmp I have:\n\topts.sources = cmp.config.sources({\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'nvim_lsp' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'crates' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'copilot' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'luasnip' },\n\t\t\t}, {\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'buffer' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'path' },\n\t\t\t\t{ name = 'emoji' },\n\t\t\t})",
